
<p class="headline">Help with HTML</p>
<p class="copy">To force a carriage return, insert &lt;br&gt;</p>
<p class="copy">To start a new paragraph return, insert &lt;p&gt;</p>
<p class="copy">This will make the page look much much tidier! You only need to 
  use these in the main part (not headlines or summarys etc).</p>
<p class="copy">You do not need to specify font types or sizes.
